{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36279","headline":"寄台州孙从事百篇 · 方干","name":"寄台州孙从事百篇","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"圣世科名酬志业，仙州秀色助神机。\n梅真入仕提雄笔，阮瑀从军着彩衣。\n昼寝不知山雪积，春游应趁夜潮归。\n相思莫讶音书晚，鸟去犹须叠日飞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"方干","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36279.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36279","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}